<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Project Information - [Your Company Name]</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello {{user.name}},</p>

    <p>We hope this message finds you well. Thank you for choosing [Your Company
      Name] for your project needs.</p>

    <p>We wanted to provide you with the details of your project. Below is the
      information we've gathered:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> {{project.name}}</li>
      <li><strong>Project ID:</strong> {{project.id}}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>To ensure a smooth process and effective management of your project, we
      kindly request you to fill out the project load details using the
      following link:</p>

    <p><a href='{{project_electric_load_url}}' target='_blank'>Fill electric
        application</a></p>

    <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to reach
      out to our team. We're here to help!</p>

    <p>Thank you for your cooperation.</p>

    <p>Best regards,
      <br />
      {{company_name}}
    </p>
  </body>
</html>